      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-10-24_WidnesExaminer_art0005" n="art0005">
        <head>BREAD AND PRIZES.</head>
        <p>BREAD AND PRIZES.</p>
        <p>We do not Bake for Prizes but for Trade, and</p>
        <p>the people of Warrington and District evidently</p>
        <p>appreciate the fact, as our Bread trade increases</p>
        <p>week by week.</p>
        <p>The Society, the Bakery, the Bread and the Prizes (in the shape of Dividend) belong to</p>
        <p>our Members.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-10-24_WidnesExaminer_art0006" n="art0006">
        <head>CHRISTMAS FRUIT.</head>
        <p>CHRISTMAS FRUIT.</p>
        <p>If you are not in the Club reserve your orders</p>
        <p>for your own Society,</p>
        <p>Christmas Fruit will be better and no dearer than last year.</p>
      </div>
