        <head>Deaths.</head>
        <p>Deaths.</p>
        <p>MAYBURY.—October 16th, Frances Maybury, 10'2, Chester-road, aged 83 years. WELSBY.—October 18th, Thomas Welsby, 58, Flumpton-street, aged 66 years. BOARDMAN.—October 18th, Alice Boardman, 335, Winwick-road, aged 81 years. WHlTTLE.—October 20th, Sarah Goulden Whittle, 61. Eldon-street, aged 74 years. BARLOW.—On the 23rd inst., at 39, Bewsey-street. William Barlow, aged 86 years. Interment at Hill Cliffe, Tuesday, 27th. at 3 o'clock.</p>
      </div>
