        <p>Coo.li-tiIiNERAL Wanted; family 4.—Apply Tuesday or Thursday, after 7 p.m., Russell, Newholme, Alexandra-road, Grappenhall. 000 K-GENERAL, about 30; Housemaid kept; IL/ 3 in family; good references; R.C.—After 6, Portland Villa, Wellington-road,' New Brighton, or by letter. - . •</p>
        <p>GENERAL, young, Required at once.-Btate wages, references, etc., to Mrs. Gerrard, 16, Lime-street, Southport. GENERAL, respectable, Wanted.—Apply Mrs. Bleakley, George and Dragon Hotel, Tyldesley. ENERAL HELP Wanted; reference re- quired; Protestant.-20, Market-street, Hoy- lake, Cheshire.</p>
